{
  "info": {
    "name": "Fancy Odds API",
    "description": "Requests for the Fancy Odds API: sports, events, live odds, the SSE stream, changes and results.\n\n**Set up**\n1. Ask for a sandbox key at https://fancyodds.live (or on Telegram).\n2. Put it in the collection variable `apiKey` (Current value only, so it is never shared).\n3. Your key works only from IP addresses on its allowlist. Send requests from the **Postman desktop app** (or the Desktop Agent) on a machine whose public IP is on your allowlist: requests sent through Postman's cloud come from Postman's servers and are refused.\n4. Run the folders in order. *In-play events* saves an `eventId`, *One event* saves a `marketId`, and the odds and results calls save their tokens, so the next requests just work.\n\nSandbox: real markets with prices 60 seconds old, up to 5 events per stream, 1 stream, 2 requests a second. Live keys use `https://api.fancyodds.live`.\n\nFull reference: https://docs.fancyodds.live \u00b7 Code examples in Node, Python, PHP and curl: https://github.com/fancy-diamond/fancyodds-api-examples",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "X-API-Key",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{apiKey}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://api-sandbox.fancyodds.live"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "sport",
      "value": "cricket"
    },
    {
      "key": "eventId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "marketId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "changesToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "resultsSince",
      "value": "0"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Start here",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Who am I",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept-Encoding",
                "value": "gzip"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Your client name, sports and limits. The first call to check that your key and IP allowlist work. [Reference](https://docs.fancyodds.live/#me)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sports",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept-Encoding",
                "value": "gzip"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/sports",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "sports"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The sports your key receives. Sport ids are slugs, e.g. `cricket`, `soccer`, `tennis`. [Reference](https://docs.fancyodds.live/#sports)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Competitions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept-Encoding",
                "value": "gzip"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/competitions?sport={{sport}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "competitions"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "sport",
                  "value": "{{sport}}",
                  "description": "Optional. One of your sports."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Competitions in one sport. [Reference](https://docs.fancyodds.live/#competitions)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Events and odds",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "In-play events",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept-Encoding",
                "value": "gzip"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/events?sport={{sport}}&state=inplay",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "events"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "sport",
                  "value": "{{sport}}",
                  "description": "Optional. cricket, soccer, \u2026"
                },
                {
                  "key": "state",
                  "value": "inplay",
                  "description": "Optional. inplay or upcoming"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Events now in play. Saves the first event id as `eventId` for the next requests. [Reference](https://docs.fancyodds.live/#events)"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "const list = Array.isArray(b) ? b : (b.events || []);",
                  "if (list.length) { pm.collectionVariables.set('eventId', list[0].id); console.log('eventId =', list[0].id, list[0].name); }",
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "One event, in full",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept-Encoding",
                "value": "gzip"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/events/{{eventId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "events",
                "{{eventId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every market and price of one event. Saves the first market id as `marketId`. Send the ETag back as If-None-Match to get 304 while nothing changed. [Reference](https://docs.fancyodds.live/#event)"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const e = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (e.markets && e.markets.length) pm.collectionVariables.set('marketId', e.markets[0].id);",
                  "const t = pm.response.headers.get('X-Resume-Token'); if (t) pm.collectionVariables.set('changesToken', t);",
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Odds for several events",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept-Encoding",
                "value": "gzip"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/odds?events={{eventId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "odds"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "events",
                  "value": "{{eventId}}",
                  "description": "Comma-separated ev_\u2026 ids"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Up to 50 events in one call; `next` is the token for /v1/changes. Saves it as `changesToken`. [Reference](https://docs.fancyodds.live/#odds)"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const b = pm.response.json(); if (b.next) pm.collectionVariables.set('changesToken', b.next);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Changes since a token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept-Encoding",
                "value": "gzip"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/changes?since={{changesToken}}&events={{eventId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "changes"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "since",
                  "value": "{{changesToken}}",
                  "description": "The next token from /v1/odds, /v1/changes or X-Resume-Token"
                },
                {
                  "key": "events",
                  "value": "{{eventId}}",
                  "description": "Comma-separated ev_\u2026 ids"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "For pollers: the latest state of each market that changed since your token, and a new `next`. Call every second or two. 410 resync means take a fresh snapshot. [Reference](https://docs.fancyodds.live/#changes)"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) { const b = pm.response.json(); if (b.next) pm.collectionVariables.set('changesToken', b.next); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Live stream (SSE)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept-Encoding",
                "value": "gzip"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "text/event-stream"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/stream?events={{eventId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "stream"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "events",
                  "value": "{{eventId}}",
                  "description": "Comma-separated ev_\u2026 ids (sandbox: up to 5)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "One connection, everything that moves: each event in full once, then only changes. A sandbox key may follow up to 5 events, listed by id, on 1 stream; `events=all` answers 400 on a sandbox key. Postman shows the messages as they arrive; stop the request to close it. [Reference](https://docs.fancyodds.live/#stream)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Results",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Results feed",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept-Encoding",
                "value": "gzip"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/results?since={{resultsSince}}&limit=500",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "results"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "since",
                  "value": "{{resultsSince}}",
                  "description": "The next from your previous call; 0 for everything kept"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "500",
                  "description": "Up to 1000 per page"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every result in order (SETTLED, CORRECTED, VOIDED, UNSETTLED). Keep `next` and pass it as `since` next time. [Reference](https://docs.fancyodds.live/#results-list)"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const b = pm.response.json(); if (b.next !== undefined) pm.collectionVariables.set('resultsSince', String(b.next));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Result of one market",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept-Encoding",
                "value": "gzip"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/markets/{{marketId}}/result",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "markets",
                "{{marketId}}",
                "result"
              ]
            },
            "description": "The current result of one market. [Reference](https://docs.fancyodds.live/#market-result)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Results of one event",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept-Encoding",
                "value": "gzip"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/events/{{eventId}}/results",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "events",
                "{{eventId}}",
                "results"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every market of one event: settled ones first, then open ones as PENDING. [Reference](https://docs.fancyodds.live/#event-results)"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
